# EtTextToggle Component - Agent Guide

## Overview

`EtTextToggle` is a text-based segmented control with smooth sliding animation. It uses a compound component pattern with `EtTextToggle.Option` subcomponents for flexible composition.

**Location:** `/libs/etoro-ui/src/components/controls/text-toggle/`

## Key Features

- **Compound Component Pattern**: Flexible composition with Option subcomponents
- **Smooth Animation**: Spring-based sliding indicator animation
- **Two Sizes**: 'small' and 'large' presets
- **Two Variants**: 'filled' (default) and 'outline' styles
- **Full Width Support**: Option to span full container width
- **Haptic Feedback**: Optional haptic feedback on selection
- **Individual Option Disabling**: Disable specific options or entire toggle
- **RTL Ready**: The indicator's anchor is pinned to the physical left edge in both directions (`right: 0` in RTL swaps back to physical left under `doLeftAndRightSwapInRTL`), so the animation math stays plain physical `onLayout.x` with no direction handling.

## Usage

```tsx
import { EtTextToggle } from 'etoro-ui';

// Basic usage
const [selectedId, setSelectedId] = useState('option1');

<EtTextToggle
  selectedId={selectedId}
  onSelectionChange={setSelectedId}
>
  <EtTextToggle.Option id="option1" label="Option 1" />
  <EtTextToggle.Option id="option2" label="Option 2" />
  <EtTextToggle.Option id="option3" label="Option 3" />
</EtTextToggle>

// Time frame selector (small, full width)
<EtTextToggle
  selectedId={selected}
  onSelectionChange={setSelected}
  size="small"
  fullWidth
>
  <EtTextToggle.Option id="1d" label="1D" />
  <EtTextToggle.Option id="1w" label="1W" />
  <EtTextToggle.Option id="1m" label="1M" />
  <EtTextToggle.Option id="3m" label="3M" />
  <EtTextToggle.Option id="1y" label="1Y" />
</EtTextToggle>

// Outline variant (transparent background with border)
<EtTextToggle
  selectedId={selected}
  onSelectionChange={setSelected}
  variant="outline"
  size="large"
  fullWidth
>
  <EtTextToggle.Option id="option1" label="Option 1" />
  <EtTextToggle.Option id="option2" label="Option 2" />
</EtTextToggle>

// With custom styling per option
const [selectedId, setSelectedId] = useState('buy');
const { colors } = useTheme(); // or import colors from your design tokens

const isBuySelected = selectedId === 'buy';
const isSellSelected = selectedId === 'sell';

<EtTextToggle selectedId={selectedId} onSelectionChange={setSelectedId}>
  <EtTextToggle.Option
    id="buy"
    label="Buy"
    textStyle={{ color: isBuySelected ? colors.actionBrandText : undefined }}
  />
  <EtTextToggle.Option
    id="sell"
    label="Sell"
    textStyle={{ color: isSellSelected ? colors.actionBrandVarText : undefined }}
  />
</EtTextToggle>
```

## Props Reference

### EtTextToggleProps (Root)

| Prop                | Type                    | Default    | Description                                                                                            |
| ------------------- | ----------------------- | ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `children`          | `ReactNode`             | -          | EtTextToggle.Option components                                                                         |
| `selectedId`        | `string`                | -          | Currently selected option ID                                                                           |
| `onSelectionChange` | `(id: string) => void`  | -          | Callback when selection changes                                                                        |
| `size`              | `'small' \| 'large'`    | `'large'`  | Size variant                                                                                           |
| `variant`           | `'filled' \| 'outline'` | `'filled'` | Visual variant: filled has semi-transparent background, outline has transparent background with border |
| `fullWidth`         | `boolean`               | `false`    | Take full container width                                                                              |
| `disabled`          | `boolean`               | `false`    | Disable entire toggle                                                                                  |
| `haptics`           | `boolean`               | `true`     | Enable haptic feedback                                                                                 |
| `style`             | `StyleProp<ViewStyle>`  | -          | Container style overrides                                                                              |
| `testID`            | `string`                | -          | Test identifier                                                                                        |

